---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "@notionglaze/ui/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | NotionGlaze">
    <main class="legal-container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: January 24, 2026</p>

        <section>
            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                NotionGlaze ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This
                Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your
                personal information when you use our service. By using
                NotionGlaze, you consent to the data practices described in this
                policy.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                We collect the minimum amount of information necessary to
                provide the Service:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Account Information:</strong> We collect your Notion User
                    ID, name, and email provided via OAuth 2.0. We do not store Notion
                    passwords.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Content Data:</strong> We access, process, and cache the
                    content of the specific Notion pages and databases you explicitly
                    share with NotionGlaze.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Usage Data:</strong> We collect anonymous telemetry about
                    dashboard usage to improve our product performance and UI.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Payment Information:</strong> Handled entirely by Paddle.com.
                    We only store subscription status, plan type, and transaction
                    IDs.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
            <p>We use your information strictly to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    Generate and host your high-performance website from Notion.
                </li>
                <li>Manage your account and subscription billing.</li>
                <li>Provide customer support and security alerts.</li>
                <li>
                    Comply with legal obligations and prevent platform abuse.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
            <p>
                <strong>Encryption:</strong> Your Notion Access Token is encrypted
                at rest using **AES-256-GCM** encryption. All data transmission is
                secured via **TLS 1.2+**.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Infrastructure:</strong> We utilize Cloudflare's global edge
                infrastructure. Data is stored in Cloudflare D1 (SQL) and images are
                cached in Cloudflare R2.
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Data Retention:</strong> We retain your data only while your
                account is active. If you delete your account, all associated tokens
                and cached content are permanently purged within 30 days.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>5. Third-Party Services (Subprocessors)</h2>
            <p>We use the following trusted third-party services:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Cloudflare:</strong> Hosting, database, and infrastructure
                    provider.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Paddle:</strong> Merchant of Record and payment gateway.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Notion:</strong> We access the Notion API to retrieve
                    your content.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>6. Your Rights (GDPR/CCPA)</h2>
            <p>
                Depending on your location, you may have the following rights:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Access & Portability:</strong> Request a copy of the data
                    we hold.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Correction:</strong> Update inaccurate information in
                    your profile.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Deletion (Right to be Forgotten):</strong> Request permanent
                    removal of your data.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Revocation:</strong> Disconnect our access to your Notion
                    workspace at any time.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                To exercise these rights, please contact us at
                <a href="mailto:privacy@notionglaze.cc"
                    >privacy@notionglaze.cc</a
                >.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>7. Merchant of Record</h2>
            <p>
                Our order process is conducted by our online reseller
                Paddle.com. Paddle.com is the Merchant of Record for all our
                orders. Paddle provides all customer service inquiries and
                handles returns.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
                us at <a href="mailto:contact@notionglaze.cc"
                    >contact@notionglaze.cc</a
                >.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
        font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--foreground);
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    section {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--foreground);
    }

    p {
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
        margin-left: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
    }

    li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    a {
        color: var(--primary);
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
